  "title": "· IN-BAG | Balenciaga's New Bag Charms: Ladybugs, Raspberries, Oranges, and Micro Bags ·",
  "original_title": "IN-BAG | Balenciaga 上市新款包包挂饰：瓢虫、树莓、橙子、袖珍包",
  "excerpt": "Balenciaga launches playful Le City bag charms in fruit and insect motifs, plus miniature versions of iconic bags, adding vibrant fun.",
  "author": "撰稿 X LING 编辑 X VIVI",
  "date_iso": "2026-08-26",
