    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Balenciaga has just unveiled a new collection of bag charms — the Le City line, crafted from pebbled lambskin, features adorable everyday motifs like oranges, raspberries, ladybugs, and flowers. With their lively shapes and vibrant hues, these charms add a playful pop to any bag. There's also a set of miniature bag charms that shrink the house's iconic silhouettes down to scale, offering a subtle yet charming way to elevate your look.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "text": "(Swipe left or right to view more images)",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Le City Charms ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This fresh lineup of charms is drawn from the Le City collection, incorporating the Motorcycle bag's most iconic details — studs, straps, and buckles — to give each charm instant recognition and a cool, edgy attitude.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🍊 The orange-shaped charm is crafted from the house's signature Arena pebbled lambskin. Flip it over and it doubles as a mirror for quick touch-ups. The green stem cleverly integrates the hook, while a gold key, a round BB emblem, and studded accents dangle below, creating a rich, layered look when attached to your bag.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
